    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1272">

                <pb facs="1518" n="1320" xml:id="pg1320"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">J. C. S. Files</note>
                <head>No. 1272<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the United States Chiefs of
                        Staff</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                        <lb/> C. C. S. 900/1 (<hi rendition="#small-caps">Terminal</hi>)</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-07-23">23 July 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Report to the President and Prime
                        Minister</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Reference: C. C. S. 900<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1272-f1"/></p>
                <p>In order to more accurately describe the boundary between the British and U. S.
                    areas of command in the Southwest Pacific, the United States Chiefs of Staff
                    recommend that the attached Appendix “C” be substituted in lieu of Appendix “C”
                    to C. C. S. 900.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d1272-f2"/></p>


                <xi:include href="d1272-a1.xml" xpointer="d1272-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1272-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1272-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1272-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1272-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed as such. Text of appendix C to C. C. S. 900 is the same as the
                    amended appendix C, <hi rendition="#italic">infra</hi>, with the omission of all
                    words in italics.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
